meta {
  name: 01_PackageLookup
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Scenario: A package can be looked up by id or by urn

    When a package is requested without an Authorization header, the request
    still succeeds
    When a package is looked up by id, the full DTO is returned
    And the same package is looked up by urn
    And an assignable package is flagged assignable
    And a non assignable package is flagged not assignable
    When an unknown package id is requested, the response is 404
    When an unknown package urn is requested, the response is 404

  The metadata API takes no token, so every step in this suite sends no
  Authorization header. This scenario also carries the one explicit check
  that the contract holds: the API answers without a header at all. The
  scenario is read only and needs no cleanup.
}
